.el .ds Aq '
.TH soundcraft-cli-describe 1  "describe " 
.SH NAME
soundcraft\-cli\-describe \- Print one engine command\*(Aqs details as JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsoundcraft\-cli describe\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print one engine command\*(Aqs details as JSON
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
One line of JSON instead of pretty\-printed
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
The command\*(Aqs id, such as file.bounce_mix
